  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support for the AU CAADP Kampala Summit 2025</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main activity is to support the African Union in organizing the Kampala CAADP Summit (January 9-11, 2025) in Kampala, Uganda. The grant award shall be utilized to cover travel, accommodation and allowance of the government officials participating in the summit, communication and public relations-related expenditures, and event catering, including running teas and meeting rooms for 2,000 delegates at the AU Summit venue, Speke Resort Munyonyo, which the Government of Uganda has selected.   
The expected effects for the target group of the activity is that the AU Heads of State declaration on the new 10-year CAADP vision for transforming Africa&#x2019;s agrifood systems &#x2013; the Kampala CAADP Declaration and Strategy and Action Plan 2026-2035.</narrative>
  </description>
